{"v":2,"lessons":[{"id":"lt:c0","title":"@c_pron","level":"@beginner","kind":"grammar","intro":"In the Lithuanian vowels, you shall find both long and short vowel sounds.","sections":[{"heading":"Vowels","body":"A a : (Short) Like “u” in “but”, (long) like “a” in “car” · Ą ą : Same as Lithuanian “a”, (short) like “u” in “but”, (long) like “a” in “car” · E e : (Short) Like “a” in “sat”, (long) like “a” in “amber” · Ę ę : Same as Lithuanian “e”, like “a” in “sat” · Ė ė : Like “e” in “bed”, but longer / more like “e” in German “mehr” · I i : Like “i” in “sit” · Į į : Like “ee” in “feet” · Y y : Same as Lithuanian “į”, like “ee” in “keep” · O o : Like “aw” in “paw” · U u : Like “u” in “put” · Ų ų : (Long only) Like “oo” in “pool” · Ū ū : Same as Lithuanian “ų”, (long only) like “oo” in “pool”"},{"heading":"Consonants","body":"B b : Like \"b\" in \"bat\". · C c : Like \"ts\" in \"cats\". · Č č : Like \"ch\" in \"cheese\". · D d : Like \"d\" in \"dad\". · F f : Like \"f\" in \"food\". · G g : Like \"g\" in \"good\". · H h : Like \"h\" in \"hat\". · J j : Like \"y\" in \"you\". · K k : Like \"k\" in \"keep\". · L l : Like \"l\" in \"look\". · M m : Like \"m\" in \"mud\". · N n : Like \"n\" in \"no\". · P p : Like \"p\" in \"pat\". · R r : Like \"r\" in \"run\" but trilled. · S s : Like \"s\" in \"sat\". · Š š : Like \"sh\" in \"sheet\". · T t : Like \"t\" in \"top\". · V v : Like \"v\" in \"very\". · Z z : Like \"z\" in \"zebra\". · Ž ž : Like \"s\" in \"treasure\"."}],"phrases":[]},{"id":"lt:c2","title":"@c_first","level":"@beginner","intro":"@c_intro","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"Labas.","f":"Salut.","r":"LAH-bahs"},{"t":"Sveikas / Sveika.","f":"Bonjour.","r":"SVAY-kahs/ svay-KAH"},{"t":"Kaip gyvuojate?","f":"Comment allez-vous ?","r":"Kayp gee-VAW-yah-ta?"},{"t":"Ačiū, gerai.","f":"Très bien, merci.","r":"AH-choo, gah-RAI"},{"t":"Koks jūsų vardas?","f":"Quel est votre nom ?","r":""},{"t":"Mano vardas yra ______ .","f":"Je m’appelle ______.","r":"MAH-naw VAHR-dahs EE-r